  "version": "0.7.0",
  "notes": "Ollama runtime model discovery: XemAi now asks Ollama which Qwen models are running and installed instead of treating the old config.json model value as authoritative. It automatically selects a deliberately running Qwen model, otherwise the most recently installed/updated Qwen model, while avoiding being trapped on a stale configured model that is merely still loaded. Capabilities, self-knowledge and comparison fallbacks use the runtime-selected model, and bootstrap exposes the selected model/source for diagnostics.",
